@end deffn
@node default toplevel
@subsection Default Toplevel

@cindex Read-Eval-Print Loop
@cindex REPL
SBCL's default toplevel function processes @ref{toplevel options},
runs @ref{initialization files}, and provides a REPL.

The toplevel function of @ref{core images} can be specified with the
@code{:toplevel} argument of @code{sb-ext:save-lisp-and-die}.

